# NOTE: Same server flags as c: radiance 1.17.0, ctx 260000, 2 seqs, fp8 KV, --gpu-headroom-mib 596, spec 7; only the .rad file differs
# NOTE: Port 8001: port 8000 is the user's own vLLM server and is never touched
# NOTE: One depth is a go/no-go gate against c at the same depth, not an engine comparison (rule 16)
# NOTE: The gate runs ONLY=iq5rs-d64000-n1,iq5rs-d80000-n1,iq5rs-d100000-n1, 1 rep each (user 2026-11-13: IQ5R only, 1 rep); 8k/32k/200k exist only because gen_campaign requires >=4 depths. Only the 100k row pairs with c (c has no 64k/80k row)
